# Optional: a GitHub personal access token with **public_repo / read-only** scope.
# Only needed to raise the 60 req/hour anonymous GitHub API rate limit when
# running `npm run portfolio -- sync` locally. In GitHub Actions the workflow
# supplies the automatic GITHUB_TOKEN instead, so nothing has to be stored here.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional: contact e-mail used by the arXiv / Crossref "polite pool" User-Agent.
# Crossref gives faster, more reliable service to requests that identify themselves.
# PORTFOLIO_CONTACT_EMAIL=

# Optional: enables `npm run portfolio -- ask "..."` natural-language shortcuts.
# Every deterministic command works without this key.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
